<title>USA: Crown Central Q4 shr profit $1.12.</title>
<headline>Crown Central Q4 shr profit $1.12.</headline>
<dateline>BALTIMORE 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Crown Central Petroleum Corp and Subsidiaries</p>
<p>			     (In thousands, except per share data)</p>
